<title>USA: Hills Stores Co Q1 May 3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Hills Stores Co Q1 May 3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					     May 3, 1997    May 4, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				    $353,504	 $370,248</p>
<p> Operating Loss				(3,820)	 (16,674)</p>
<p> Net Loss				     ( 9,820)	( 14,738)</p>
<p> Loss per share				( 0.95)	  ( 1.45)</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding			   10,346	   10,166</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 quarter included pretax non-cash charge $11.7 million, or $7.2 million after tax. The per share charge after tax was $0.71.</p>
</text>
